  "_comment": "The 24-tone vocabulary. One meaning per tone (PLAN 6.1). act_active = act number from which Lily may use the tone (PLAN 6.3). audio_profile drives procedural synthesis in tones/synth.py (PLAN 6.4). MUSIC: every tone sits on one shared A-minor-pentatonic scale (A C D E G) so any combination is consonant. `note` = scale step from synth.ROOT (A3=220Hz): 0=root, +5=octave up, negative=down. `base_freq` is the resolved Hz (kept for readability; synth recomputes from `note`). Each glyph's pitch is chosen to fit its meaning, registers cluster by category.",
